{"id":2877,"date":"2017-03-01T10:30:20","date_gmt":"2017-03-01T16:30:20","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/pn2.mikerezl.com\/?p=2877"},"modified":"2017-03-01T10:39:40","modified_gmt":"2017-03-01T16:39:40","slug":"poker-night-in-america-signs-new-title-sponsor-kimo-sabe-mezcal","status":"publish","type":"post","link":"https:\/\/pokernight.com\/poker-night-in-america-signs-new-title-sponsor-kimo-sabe-mezcal\/","title":{"rendered":"Poker Night in America Signs New Title Sponsor &#8211; Kimo Sabe Mezcal"},"content":{"rendered":"<p>[et_pb_section transparent_background=&#8221;off&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#f2f2f2&#8243; allow_player_pause=&#8221;off&#8221; inner_shadow=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method=&#8221;off&#8221; custom_padding=&#8221;|0px||0px&#8221; make_fullwidth=&#8221;off&#8221; use_custom_width=&#8221;off&#8221; width_unit=&#8221;on&#8221; custom_width_px=&#8221;1080px&#8221; custom_width_percent=&#8221;80%&#8221; make_equal=&#8221;off&#8221; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;off&#8221; fullwidth=&#8221;off&#8221; specialty=&#8221;off&#8221; admin_label=&#8221;section&#8221; disabled=&#8221;off&#8221;][et_pb_row make_fullwidth=&#8221;on&#8221; use_custom_width=&#8221;off&#8221; width_unit=&#8221;on&#8221; custom_width_px=&#8221;1080px&#8221; custom_width_percent=&#8221;80%&#8221; use_custom_gutter=&#8221;on&#8221; gutter_width=&#8221;1&#8243; background_color=&#8221;#f2f2f2&#8243; allow_player_pause=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method=&#8221;off&#8221; make_equal=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_1=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method_1=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_2=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method_2=&#8221;on&#8221; parallax_3=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method_3=&#8221;on&#8221; parallax_4=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method_4=&#8221;on&#8221; admin_label=&#8221;row&#8221; disabled=&#8221;off&#8221;][et_pb_column type=&#8221;4_4&#8243; disabled=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax=&#8221;off&#8221; parallax_method=&#8221;off&#8221;][et_pb_text background_layout=&#8221;light&#8221; text_orientation=&#8221;left&#8221; admin_label=&#8221;Text&#8221; background_color=&#8221;#f2f2f2&#8243; use_border_color=&#8221;off&#8221; border_style=&#8221;solid&#8221; disabled=&#8221;off&#8221;]<\/p>\n<h3><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kimo Sabe To Be Exclusive High-End Spirit For Televised Episodes and Live Streams<\/span><\/i><\/h3>\n<p><b>Chicago, IL (February 5th, 2017)<\/b><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> \u2013 The hit TV series <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America, <\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">produced by Rush Street Productions, has just signed Kimo Sabe Mezcal, the drink for Trusted Friends, as their new title sponsor of all nationally televised episodes and live stream events. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">\u201cThis partnership with Kimo Sabe is a perfect fit for us,\u201d said Todd Anderson, President of Rush Street Productions. \u00a0\u201cKimo Sabe means \u2018Trusted Friend\u2019, and that is what we are all about&#8230;having a great time with friends around the poker table.\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">&#8220;We embrace this opportunity to partner with <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and our trusted friend Phil Hellmuth, as we introduce our lively spirit to the poker playing community,\u201d said Ashley Walsh Kvamme, COO and Co-Founder of Kimo Sabe Mezcal. \u00a0\u201cNothing keeps the party &#8211; or in this case the game &#8211; going longer, and with more enjoyment, than the combination of trusted friends and Kimo Sabe Mezcal.\u201d<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Since rolling out over the last year in California, Nevada, Arizona and New Jersey, Kimo Sabe has elevated the mezcal experience and is becoming the drink of choice among millennials and social imbibers. <\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mezcal is the ceremonial Mexican spirit that captures the flavors of dozens of types of agave, whereas tequila uses only one kind of agave. Although the two are often confused, when comparing flavors mezcal is like a color painting, while tequila is like a charcoal drawing. Kimo Sabe\u2019s proprietary distilling process even includes an innovative ultrasound technology and a rare copper third distillation that results in a smooth, multi-note drinking experience that unfolds with each sip. With this unprecedented approach that seamlessly blends traditional techniques with modern ingenuity, Kimo Sabe has created a product that is sexy, fun and intriguing, while leading the way in raising the profile of the mezcal movement. \u00a0<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">As part of the sponsorship, the Kimo Sabe Mezcal logo will be displayed on the table, on the flop camera, and on all hole card cameras. \u00a0They will also air commercial spots, other in-show mentions, and billboards, along with a graphic overlay on live stream events. \u00a0<\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America <\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">will also debut a new segment where cast members interview each other about poker, life, and anecdotes of their own trusted friends while enjoying Kimo Sabe Mezcal. \u00a0This will showcase the Kimo Sabe message, and help <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> achieve its goal of bringing fun and friends back to poker.<\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Rush Street Productions and Kimo Sabe Mezcal will work together to promote the game of poker as a great way to spend time with trusted friends, and to share the drinks around which memories are made. \u00a0For more information about Kimo Sabe Mezcal, visit <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.kimosabemezcal.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">www.kimosabemezcal.com<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">For a sneak peek at the Kimo Sabe commercial spot click this link:<\/span><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><br \/>\n<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/youtu.be\/VvhBmdm6jSo\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">https:\/\/youtu.be\/VvhBmdm6jSo<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3>About Rush Street Productions<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Founded in 2013, Rush Street Productions brought America\u2019s true pastime, Texas Hold\u2019em Poker, to television sets nationwide on CBS Sports Network with their hit series <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America. \u00a0<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Currently in their fifth season, and with over 100 episodes produced, <\/span><i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Poker Night in America<\/span><\/i><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> continues to showcase amazing cash game poker each week played by the game\u2019s best players and celebrities. \u00a0For more information, visit <\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/pokernight.com\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">pokernight.com<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or follow Poker Night on <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.twitter.com\/pokernighttv\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Twitter<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.youtube.com\/pokernight\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Youtube<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">, and <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/www.twitch.tv\/pokernighttv\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Twitch<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>&nbsp;<\/p>\n<h3>About Kimo Sabe Mezcal:<\/h3>\n<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Kimo Sabe Mezcal, translated to &#8220;a trusted friend&#8221; is a premium family-crafted artisan mezcal imported from the rich soils of Oaxaca, Mexico. The family-owned spirit company is run by father-daughter team Jim and Ashley Walsh, who bring years of experience in the agricultural production of food and drink flavors. Jim and Ashley Walsh oversee every step of Kimo Sabe production \u2013 from the cultivation of agave plants in both Oaxaca and Zacatecas, Mexico through its family-crafted artisan distillation process and all the way to consumers&#8217; tables, providing a new ultra-premium mezcal taste and quality. The mezcal&#8217;s soft, creamy mouth feel and perfect flavor balance creates a new category of refined mezcal, unlike any of the old rustic mezcals. \u00a0With its clean pure flavor and complex taste notes, Kimo Sabe can be enjoyed as an everyday sipping or mixing mezcal. Why settle for tequila? Step up to Kimo Sabe. For more information, visit <\/span><a href=\"http:\/\/kimosabemezcal.com\/\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">kimosabemezcal.com<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> or follow Kimo Sabe on<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/kimosabemezcal\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Facebook<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">,<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/twitter.com\/kimosabemezcal\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Twitter<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> and<\/span><a href=\"https:\/\/instagram.com\/kimosabemezcal\/\"> <span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Instagram<\/span><\/a><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">. <\/span><\/p>\n<p>[\/et_pb_text][\/et_pb_column][\/et_pb_row][\/et_pb_section]<\/p>\n<span class=\"et_bloom_bottom_trigger\"><\/span>","protected":false},"excerpt":{"rendered":"<p>Kimo Sabe To Be Exclusive High-End Spirit For Televised Episodes and Live Streams Chicago, IL (February 5th, 2017) \u2013 The hit TV series Poker Night in America, produced by Rush Street Productions, has just signed Kimo Sabe Mezcal, the drink for Trusted Friends, as their new title sponsor of all nationally televised episodes and live [&hellip;]<\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":6,"featured_media":2878,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"open","sticky":false,"template":